no_supported_cameras.description:
None of the cameras on {console} support UniFi Protect's visible watermark, so UniFi Protect Watermark has no entities to add.

The visible watermark needs UniFi Protect {min_protect_version} or newer, camera firmware {min_firmware} or newer, and a camera model that supports it, such as the G6 series.

UniFi Protect: {protect_version}

Cameras:
{cameras}

If UniFi Protect, or the firmware of a camera model that supports the watermark, is out of date, update it in UniFi Protect, then reload UniFi Protect Watermark. This message goes away once a camera supports the watermark.
